<blockquote>
<p>Radar trackers and multi-spectral cameras are supplied. Objective is to determine the nature of the being encountered during Expedition Gamma.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'd refrain from using the word 'being', especially at this point. They have no idea about that yet.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Command: It’ll be okay, ████. Just try to find shelter. There should be something in the mountains</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Is command using her name? Bit unprofessional, but understandable I guess.</p>
<p>Are they sending in D-Class in a tank? Even if they don't want to lose MTF personnel, I can't imagine the Foundation trusting D-Class with this. What if they return and decide that they've had enough of their imprisonment? They'd be in a freaking tank. It's going to be <em>hard</em> to explain to your superiors why the Site suddenly has a gigantic hole in it and a tank is missing.</p>
<p>The rest of it is really interesting though. I just hope it's not Hell. That would be cliché. And on the nose.</p>

